harmattan-gui: how to build and install the .deb package

BUILD:
    sudo apt-get install devscripts build-essential
    dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc -b

    This will produce ../harmattan_3.21.0-1_amd64.deb

INSTALL:
    sudo dpkg -i ../harmattan_3.21.0-1_amd64.deb
    sudo apt-get install -f  # install missing dependencies

SYSTEM DEPENDENCIES:
    sudo apt-get install nmap python3-pyqt6 python3-flask python3-scapy

LAUNCH:
    harmattan
    # or from application menu: HARMATTAN

NOTES:
    - ARP scanning and traffic capture need root or CAP_NET_RAW:
      sudo setcap cap_net_raw,cap_net_admin+eip /usr/bin/python3.12
    - The API token is auto-generated on first run
    - Config: /etc/harmattan/env
    - Data: ~/.local/share/harmattan/
